~ start
Merchant: I can pay the official passage due into the village chest. If I must pass quickly I will put extra coin in your purse.
- Record the official due in the village chest
	do tuccar_etki("harc")
	Merchant: Let the due go to the village chest. I will speak with the shopkeeper in the market afterwards.
	=> end
- Leave it in your purse and let me through
	do tuccar_etki("rusvet")
	Merchant: It is in your purse. One villager's work will be heavier today; send word to the next shopkeeper.
	=> end
- Turn back for this stay
	do tuccar_etki("ret")
	Merchant: Then I take the road back. Pass to the next person waiting at the gate.
	=> end

~ end
